    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92557" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοβδεῖ:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναρριπτεῖ μετ᾽ ἤχους</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοιβδέω</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥόβιλλος:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βασιλίσκος ὄρνις</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοβλεῖ:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοφεῖ, πνεῖ</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥοβοπώλης</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥωποπώλης</span>
			. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥόγαν:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν φονέα, τὸν αὐτόχειρα</span>, Id.
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥόγαν:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥῶγα</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥογεῖ:</span></b> 
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀργᾶ, ἀκμάζει, δαμάζει</span>,
		Id.</div>
